---
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
const year = 2026;
---
<footer class="site-footer site-footer--brand-clean">
  <div class="container site-footer__wrap">
    <div class="site-footer__topline">
      <div class="site-footer__brand">{SITE_NAME}</div>
      <a class="site-footer__consult" href="https://book4painter.notion.site/200d1fa59b798035a614f3ab95d779e3?pvs=105" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">상담 신청</a>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__content-grid">
      <section class="site-footer__section">
        <h3>주소와 연락처</h3>
        <p><strong>광교본원</strong> : 경기도 수원시 영통구 대학로 101, 201호 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 031-216-2322</p>
        <p><strong>망포분원</strong> : 경기도 수원시 영통구 망포로 142, 202호 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 070-7818-2322</p>
        <p><strong>이메일</strong> : <a href="mailto:book4painter@naver.com">book4painter@naver.com</a></p>
      </section>

      <section class="site-footer__section">
        <h3>채널 안내</h3>
        <ul class="site-footer__link-list">
          <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/book4painter_/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://blog.naver.com/book4painter" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="http://pf.kakao.com/_xnKduj" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">카카오채널 광교</a></li>
          <li><a href="http://pf.kakao.com/_XtQRX" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">카카오채널 망포</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://naver.me/Fytbc9Hr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">네이버플레이스 광교</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://naver.me/xCjmmCRZ" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">네이버플레이스 망포</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__bottom">
      <span>ⓒ {year} {SITE_NAME}. All rights reserved.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer--brand-clean {
    background: #12779a;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    border-top: none;
    margin-top: 0;
    padding: 64px 0 34px;
  }

  .site-footer__wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .site-footer__topline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .site-footer__brand {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .site-footer__consult {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.72rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .site-footer__consult:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .site-footer__content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 2rem 3rem;
  }

  .site-footer__section h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .site-footer__section p {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .site-footer__link-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.55rem 1rem;
  }

  .site-footer--brand-clean a {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .site-footer__bottom {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .site-footer__content-grid,
    .site-footer__link-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
